Revitalizing the skin, it effectively combats signs of aging. <\/p><p>Additionally, it fosters skin healing, visibly reducing redness and inflammation.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--20374060532018__c6a0b16d-e893-4a84-b80f-79c16d21141c-row-1","template--20374060532018__c6a0b16d-e893-4a84-b80f-79c16d21141c-row-2","template--20374060532018__c6a0b16d-e893-4a84-b80f-79c16d21141c-row-3"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"image_height":"medium","desktop_image_width":"medium","heading_size":"h1","text_style":"body","button_style":"secondary","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","image_layout":"alternate-left","section_color_scheme":"background-1","row_color_scheme":"background-1","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"c5eaadcc-cda0-431f-9cc6-bb5fec76a795":{"type":"multicolumn","blocks":{"template--20374060532018__c5eaadcc-cda0-431f-9cc6-bb5fec76a795-column-1":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/step1.webp","title":"Apply Serum","text":"<p>To achieve optimal results, simply apply a few drops of any serum before use. This not only enhances the effects but also facilitates smooth application.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--20374060532018__c5eaadcc-cda0-431f-9cc6-bb5fec76a795-column-2":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/step2.webp","title":"Glide FaceWand®","text":"<p>Gently glide FaceWand® along your skin, moving in upward and outward motions. 3 minutes for each area of the skin during use.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"template--20374060532018__c5eaadcc-cda0-431f-9cc6-bb5fec76a795-column-3":{"type":"column","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/step3.webp","title":"Hydrate","text":"<p>Apply your preferred moisturizer or cream to your face and neck, effectively sealing in hydration.<\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}}},"block_order":["template--20374060532018__c5eaadcc-cda0-431f-9cc6-bb5fec76a795